<title>ESTONIA: HANSA LIISING ISSUES NEW 30 MLN KROONS OF CPS.</title>
<headline>HANSA LIISING ISSUES NEW 30 MLN KROONS OF CPS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hansapank subsidiary Hansa Liising will issue new commercial papers worth 30 million kroons on April 15, the bank said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The yield on the six-month paper is 8.5 percent, Ulo Kallas, Hansapank's manager of interest rate products, told Reuters.</p>
<p>Hansa Liising is to reedem its previous issue of 30 million kroons of three-month CPs, which had a yield of 7.87 percent, on Thursday, Kallas added.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn newsroom, +372 630 8400, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
